text:
Fair enough — your call, and Mon 14:00–14:30 works for me; Wed 10:00 if the team's better on that one. Just tell me which and I'll block it.

What would help me most before then:
- the section outline you have in mind (scope and how many slides/minutes you expect), so I can trim mine to fit;
- the review notes or feedback from last term's version of this section, if they're around;
- whether you want the material in shape before the meeting or just a clear plan of it — that changes how I spend the next few days.

I'll also send the team a short note with the section's status so nobody's guessing. And I'll keep the department office in the loop on the time once you confirm it.
